:: start

<<dialog "Aldra">>
  I'm not drinking the antidote. Not today. Not tomorrow.
<</dialog>>

<<dialog "Mira">>
  It's yours. The choice and the vial. Both.
<</dialog>>

<<dialog "Edric" "portrait">>
  For what it's worth — I'm glad.
<</dialog>>

<<dialog "Aldric" "portrait">>
  For what it's worth — I'm glad.
<</dialog>>

<<dialog "Aldra" "portrait">>
  Something about this town feels different.
<</dialog>>

